      <!--Q#-->
      
        <exercise>
          <problem>
            <para>What is the correlation coefficient for this data and what does it tell us about the strength and type of relationship represented?</para>
            <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Compare your answer: Your answer many vary, but here is a sample.</para>
            <para> The correlation coefficient is \(r≈0.44\). By the table, this indicates a moderate, positive
    linear relationship between fat content and calories.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      
